Prompt: How many properties are owned by an LLC, search all fields in the row to determine this.

Generated SQL:
SELECT
  COUNT(*)
FROM v_all
WHERE
  owner_name ILIKE '%LLC%' OR
  legal_owner ILIKE '%LLC%' OR
  entity_type ILIKE '%LLC%' OR
  company_name ILIKE '%LLC%' OR
  description ILIKE '%LLC%' OR
  notes ILIKE '%LLC%' OR
  owner_address ILIKE '%LLC%';

